00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,960
Thanks a lot. I mean that.

257
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:36,620
I'm standing. Hey, look.

258
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:38,050
He's up.

259
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,340
You did it.

260
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:41,187
That means you win the duel.

261
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:42,830
Hey, guys.

262
00:14:42,913 --> 00:14:43,743
I'm lost.

263
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:46,566
Could you fill me in, please?

264
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,417
You're dueling in the finals?

265
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:49,997
And you scared us, you dope.

266
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,437
Don't ever do that again.

267
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:52,350
I'm sorry.

268
00:14:53,460 --> 00:14:54,290
Huh?

269
00:14:54,373 --> 00:14:55,460
But who's that guy?

270
00:14:57,020 --> 00:14:59,320
Oh, yeah, I remember.

271
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,540
Obey me!

272
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:03,100
And attack my opponent right now! Joey!

273
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:04,880
Get down from there!

274
00:15:05,940 --> 00:15:07,200
Hey, you okay?

275
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:12,286
This card went nuts, and that's
the last thing that I remember.

276
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:16,160
And so the winner of this
duel is Joey Wheeler!

277
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,520
So I won?

278
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:19,780
Yes, you did.

279
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,100
I knew you would!

280
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:22,910
Oh, right.

281
00:15:22,993 --> 00:15:26,560
So, who's my main man? Wait. What's up?

282
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:28,677
I think the other guy's still hurt.

283
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:31,560
Looks like Wheeler's dumb
luck saved him again.

284
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:33,200
And I emphasize dumb.

285
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:36,137
But what happened to
Merrick's Egyptian God card?

286
00:15:36,220 --> 00:15:37,455
Why didn't it attack?

287
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,377
I know there wasn't a glitch
in his dual disc because I've

288
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:43,657
spared no expense to make sure
my equipment is problem-free.

289
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:47,420
That card should have worked
unless his card was a fake.

290
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,140
Come on, man. Wake up.

291
00:15:52,420 --> 00:15:54,360
Please forgive me, Joey.

292
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,760
I'm sorry.

293
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:58,780
It was an honor for me to duel with you.

294
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:01,100
Well, same to you.

295
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:05,017
And thanks to that lightning bolt, I
won't forget this duel for a while.

296
00:16:05,100 --> 00:16:07,157
Now that it's done, you gotta come clean.

297
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,769
If you're not Marek,
then who are you, pal?

298
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:15,340
I am only a servant of
the real Master Marek.

299
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:17,180
That's Marek?

300
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:20,980
It's that rod!

301
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:23,967
It looks just like the
one that other guy had

302
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,997
That must be the real
Millennium Rod Which means

303
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:33,320
Namu's the real Merrick Admit
your true identity, Merrick

304
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:38,120
Yes, it's true I am
indeed the real Merrick,

305
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:41,217
you fools Then he must
have the real Winged

306
00:16:41,300 --> 00:16:44,540
Dragon of Ra So Namu lied to us all along?

307
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,270
Namu,

308
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:49,777
he was a disguise to get
me closer to Yugi You

309
00:16:49,860 --> 00:16:52,880
little worm He's the
one who brainwashed you

310
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:57,180
So, Pharaoh, we finally meet face to face

311
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Master Now at last,

312
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:05,320
I can finish the job my
pathetic servants couldn't Yugi,

313
00:17:05,780 --> 00:17:11,237
your puzzle and power will soon
be where they belong Oh no,

314
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:15,200
I was afraid of this
We're all in great danger.

315
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:19,830
Beware.

316
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:22,840
The great evil hidden within.

317
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:25,008
What are you talking about?

318
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:30,000
Master Merrick has a darker side, and
I am unable to contain it anymore.

319
00:17:30,580 --> 00:17:31,980
It's too late now.

320
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:34,420
What's too late?

321
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:39,420
Let me out.

322
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:41,560
You can't frustrate me anymore.

323
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:48,760
I'm going to file this in
the category of not good.

324
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:52,240
Merrick, what's going on?

325
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,740
I'm finally free again.

326
00:17:58,620 --> 00:18:01,820
Which means I can do things my way.

327
00:18:02,460 --> 00:18:07,300
I was restrained for many years
by that fool, Odeon. Who are you?

328
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:12,237
I'm the true Merrick, and I'm not as
kind as the one you've come to know.

329
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:17,300
And soon I'll finish the job he couldn't
complete and strip you of your powers.

330
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,840
For I deserve to be feral.

331
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,280
Not you.

332
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:25,000
So get ready for the real battle.

333
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:30,500
And when I'm full with you, your puzzle
will be around my neck where it belongs.

334
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:35,980
And you will be trapped forever
in the realm of eternal darkness.

335
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,620
Along with your friends.

336
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:41,060
And Odeon as well.

337
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:45,280
Hey, pal, get a life. You fool.

338
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:48,720
Thanks to Odeon's failure,
I now have a life.

339
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:52,620
Of course, by failing,
Odeon did prove one thing.

340
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:56,500
Only a chosen few can control
the Egyptian god cards.

341
00:18:56,820 --> 00:18:58,340
Kaiba, you're one.

342
00:18:58,900 --> 00:19:02,940
Marek, I'm sick and tired of
hearing these Egyptian fairy tales.

343
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:07,460
I control Ovelist the Tormenter
because I am a master duelist.

344
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:10,400
Don't deny your ancient past.

345
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:14,820
You'll find you can't escape
your 5,000-year-old memories.

346
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:17,760
You'll learn in good time, Kaiba.

347
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:22,100
Your role in this game runs much
deeper than you can imagine.

348
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:26,320
However, that won't
matter once I take over.

349
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:28,405
Just as my necklace predicted,

350
00:19:28,580 --> 00:19:31,737
a great disturbance in the
mystic alignment has awakened

351
00:19:31,820 --> 00:19:35,320
a deeper evil that's long been
dormant inside of Merrick.

352
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:38,777
And the goodness within my
brother's heart is now a small

353
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:43,620
spark covered beneath a fog
of utter darkness and despair.

354
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:49,920
Yugi, the battle for the Pharaoh's
power will begin right now.

355
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:54,400
A conflict 5,000 years in the
making, and there's no turning back.

356
00:19:57,500 --> 00:20:00,737
The great Egyptian god
monsters will serve and

357
00:20:00,820 --> 00:20:03,960
protect me while I rule the
earth as the new Pharaoh!

358
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,680
You're alone
